{"nodes": [{"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_expense_tracker_module", "label": "Expense Tracker Module", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_envelope_budgeting", "label": "Envelope Budgeting", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A budget is a named pot with a fixed start_date/end_date window and no recurring cadence; a monthly rhythm is many budgets, one per month. Dropping recurrence is what makes drawdown a single SUM."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_budget", "label": "Budget", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model / Tables", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_expense", "label": "Expense", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model / Tables", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_category", "label": "Expense Tracker Category", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Tables", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Categories are global reference data with 7 seeded rows and no CRUD yet; deleting one is RESTRICTed while anything references it."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_server_side_budget_resolution", "label": "Server-Side Budget Resolution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model / Business Rules", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Clients never send budget_id; the server derives it from category and date so resolution cannot be spoofed or drift. Category-specific budgets beat overall ones so groceries hit the Food pot rather than the catch-all."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_unbudgeted_expense", "label": "Unbudgeted Expense (budget_id null)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spending no budget covers is still recorded with budget_id = null, because refusing to log real spending would be worse than leaving it unbudgeted."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_one_budget_per_scope_per_window", "label": "One Budget Per Scope Per Window", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model / Business Rules", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Overlapping budgets for the same scope are rejected at create time with 409. Enforcing uniqueness at write time makes budget resolution unambiguous and 'what's left' a single SUM at read time."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_budget_envelope", "label": "_budget Response Envelope", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Response Format", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The created expense echoes a _budget object naming which pot it landed in, or null when unbudgeted \u2014 without it the server-side resolution would be invisible to the caller."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_duplicate_detection", "label": "Duplicate Expense Detection", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Duplicate Warning / Business Rules", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same title + amount + date within 5 minutes attaches a _warning but still succeeds \u2014 a legitimate repeat purchase must not be blocked, so detection warns rather than rejects."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_base_entity", "label": "BaseEntity Timestamp Stripping", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Tables", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "created_at, updated_at (trigger-maintained) and deleted_at (soft delete) are stripped from every client payload by BaseEntity so they can never be set from a request body."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_current_user_middleware", "label": "currentUser Identity Seam", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Auth", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src/middleware/currentUser.js resolves every request to the seeded dev user (id 1) and is deliberately the only place identity is decided \u2014 controllers pass req.user.id down and every query filters on user_id, so shipping real auth means replacing exactly one file."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_raw_sql_queries_layer", "label": "Raw SQL Queries Layer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Data Access Style", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Raw SQL over the shared pg Pool from src/config/db.js with no ORM, and all SQL confined to *.queries.js files \u2014 never a service or controller \u2014 so ownership filtering has exactly one layer to audit."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_migration_004_removals", "label": "Migration 004 Deliberate Removals", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Deliberately Removed", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tags, the expense-tag junction, payment methods, is_recurring and budget `period` were dropped because each was unreferenced or ambiguous; budget `period` in particular made drawdown unresolvable since summing expenses against a recurring rule spans every period at once."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_ownership_filtering", "label": "Ownership Filtering", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Business Rules", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ownership is always taken from req.user.id; a user_id supplied in a request body is rejected outright."}, {"id": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_api_endpoints", "label": "Expense Tracker API Endpoints", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Endpoints", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only POST /budgets/crt and POST /expenses/crt exist under /api/v1/expense_tracker; read, update and delete are not built and category CRUD is deferred because the 7 seeded categories cover normal use."}], "edges": [{"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_expense_tracker_module", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_envelope_budgeting", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "lines 3-4", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_envelope_budgeting", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_budget", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_expense", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_budget", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "'An expense draws from exactly one budget, or none'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_expense", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_category", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "category_id on expense payload", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_budget", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_category", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "optional category_id on budget payload", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_server_side_budget_resolution", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_expense", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "Model / Create Expense", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_server_side_budget_resolution", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_category", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/modules/expense-tracker/README.md", "source_location": "'from the expense's category and date'", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_one_budget_per_scope_per_window", "target": "src_modules_expense_tracker_readme_server_side_budget_resolution", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_fil